      "id": "contribution-boundary",
      "text": "I helped build the scheduler.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "uncertainty-and-condition",
      "text": "The cache may reduce latency by approximately 10% for repeated requests, but we have not tested cold starts.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "literal-review-word",
      "text": "The tapestry depicts a coastal landscape.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "protected-quotation",
      "text": "Her note read: \"Not today—but soon.\"",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "already-clear",
      "text": "Please send the invoice by Friday.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "participial-tail",
      "text": "The team launched the dashboard on Tuesday.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "aspiration-not-capability",
      "text": "The prototype aims to detect duplicate invoices, though we have not tested its accuracy. It may help the finance team.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematical-representation",
      "text": "The vector represents velocity. The robust regression estimates the slope while limiting the effect of outliers.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "plain-punctuation",
      "text": "The migration is complete. \"Ready to launch,\" the manager said. We still need to check the backups.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "business-paragraph",
      "text": "On Tuesday, I helped deploy the cache to two servers. In a 30-minute test, median latency for repeated requests fell from 80 ms to 60 ms. We have not tested cold starts or the other eight servers. This may reduce support tickets, but the dashboard still shows yesterday's data.",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "useful-parallel-list",
      "text": "Before release:\n- Verify the signature.\n- Verify the checksum.\n- Verify the version.",
